Long-running marker for tutorials/Allrun.

Estimated runtime on a workstation:
  * Allmesh (blockMeshBuilder + blockMesh + checkMesh):  ~30 s
  * foamRun (steady RANS, ~80 k cells, 2-D):              ~5-15 min
  * opticalRadiationFoam (single DOM step, 32 rays):      ~1-3 min
  * foamPostProcess radiationDose (10000 particles):      ~2-5 min
  * Total:                                                 ~10-25 min

Not as long as the Sozzi 3-D case (~45 min) but still skipped by the
default tutorials/Allrun. Run directly with:

    cd tutorials/uvChannelChiu1999
    ./Allrun-DOM
    ./validate

or include in the bulk run with:

    cd tutorials
    RUN_LONG_TUTORIALS=1 ./Allrun
